<details class="advanced" id="saved-worlds"><summary>Your saved worlds <span>+</span></summary><p>Keep barriers, spawn, direction, world settings, and personal gesture training. No images, camera alignment, or tracked objects are saved.</p><label for="world-title">World name</label><input id="world-title" type="text" maxlength="60" value="My little world"/><button class="secondary wide" id="save-world">Keep this world</button><label for="world-library">Recent worlds on this browser</label><select id="world-library" aria-label="Saved world"></select><button class="secondary wide" id="restore-world" disabled>Restore selected world</button><div class="two-buttons"><button class="quiet" id="export-world">Export world ↗</button><label class="file-button" for="import-world">Import world<input id="import-world" type="file" accept=".json,application/json"/></label></div><p class="microcopy" id="world-status">Save explicitly here, or keep a portable world file.</p></details>
